<title>EGYPT: Cairo airport fuel tank fire brought under control.</title>
<headline>Cairo airport fuel tank fire brought under control.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A fuel storage tank caught fire at Cairo's international airport on Sunday and threatened to spread to five other tanks until firefighters brought it under control, airport sources said.</p>
<p>They said there were no details about any casualties or the exact size of the tanks. Authorities are investigating the cause of the blaze, they added.</p>
</text>
